	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Capture text into an Org inbox from anywhere in macOS.

USAGE
  i &lt;text&gt;   type a note directly in Alfred
  hotkey     capture the current selection; with nothing selected it
             reopens Alfred prefilled with `i ' so the same key also types

Each capture is appended as `* TODO &lt;text&gt;' followed by a blank line, and
confirms with a notification and a sound.

REQUIREMENT
  An `inbox' script on PATH (or at ~/.config/shell/bin/inbox) that takes the
  text as its argument and appends it to your inbox file. A reference
  implementation ships in the repo above as shell/bin/inbox.

NOTES
  Assign your own hotkey in the Hotkey object; the shipped one is a
  placeholder. Multi-line selections are collapsed to a single heading.
</string>
